        "content": "```python\ndef solution():\n    # Define variables name and value\n    import math\n\n    S = 85\n    K = 90\n    r = 0.05\n    T = 5\n    c = 10\n    p = 15\n\n    # Do math calculation to get the answer\n    discounted_strike = K * math.exp(-r * T)\n    dividend_discount_factor = (c - p + discounted_strike) / S\n    implied_dividend_yield = -math.log(dividend_discount_factor) / T\n    answer = round(implied_dividend_yield * 100, 3)\n\n    # return answer\n    return answer\n```",
